                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows Vista/7/8<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> AMD/Intel quad-core processor running at 3.2 GHz (Intel Core i5 2nd gen or AMD FX 8350 or newer architectures are recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> ATI/NVIDIA dedicated or mobile graphic card with at least 1GB of dedicated VRAM and with at least DirectX 9.0c and Shader Model 4.0 support. ATI/AMD Radeon HD6850 and NVIDIA GeForce GTX460 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 3 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> Integrated or dedicated DirectX 9 compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Input devices: Keyboard and mouse</li></ul>"
            },
            "mac_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> MAC OS X 10.6.8 (Snow Leopard), 10.7.5 (Lion), 10.8.5 (Mountain Lion) or 10.9.4 (Mavericks)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel quad-core processor running at 3.1 GHz  (Intel Core i5  2nd  gen or newer architectures) # 4 GB RAM or better for MAC OS X 10.6.8 (Snow Leopard), 10.7.5 (Lion), 10.8.5 (Mountain Lion) or 10.9.4 (Mavericks)<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Intel integrated or mobile graphic card, with at least 768MB of dedicated or shared VRAM and with at least Shader Model 5.0 support. Intel HD4000 and above are minimum required graphic cards.<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 3 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> Integrated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Input devices: Keyboard and mouse</li></ul>"
